<Slide style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60 }}>
  <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 600, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 460, height: 600, backgroundColor: '#0F2A5C', borderRadius: 16, padding: 36, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 3, color: '#93C5FD' }}>一个源码级的细节</Text>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 200, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1 }}>32</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBBF24', lineHeight: 1.2, paddingBottom: 14 }}>位</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FBBF24' }}>0xFFFFFFFF</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          GXID 的取值上限，来自 gtm_gxid.h
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>MaxGlobalTransactionId</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 2, color: '#2563EB' }}>05 / 一处较真</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 1, backgroundColor: '#E2E8F0' }} />
      </Box>

      <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 16 }}>
        网上说 64 位，源码说 32 位
      </Text>

      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 18 }}>
        不少讲 OpenTenBase 的文章写「GXID 是 64 位整数，支持 18 亿以上事务」。我按这个说法去查源码，看到的却是另一回事。
      </Text>

      <Box style={{ marginTop: 20 }}>
        <CodeBlock
          code={`#define MaxGlobalTransactionId    ((GlobalTransactionId) 0xFFFFFFFF)`}
          language='c'
          width={620}
          fontSize={14}
          theme='github-light'
          macHeader={false}
        />
      </Box>

      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20 }}>
        顺手记住这个教训：二手结论，回源码核一遍。
      </Text>

    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 60, bottom: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>07 / 09</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
